msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫If I’m not mistaken, the Maid had cue cards in the ⟪k:3⟫other⟪k:4⟫ extra as well."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Si je ne me trompe pas, la Servante a des fiches personnages dans les ⟪k:3⟫"
"autres⟪k:4⟫ extra également."

#: omake:omake_0C1A5A5D_E844_492A_B3FC_6EB72EA38AB9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
