msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Actually, since we’re here, maybe we should start with the two of you before we "
"head out."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫En fait, puisqu’on est là, on devrait peut-être commencer par vous deux."

#: omake:omake_D8F9ED98_CB55_414A_BCD3_1718D1E71F73
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9ef7ac5adc9aea1c347dffe1f4f2f551c693dbd2b9b1dd3ef88e3d6a8914dfbe
