msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫That is true... ⟪k:2⟫At first, Mell seemed like a fairly likable young man,⟪k:3⟫but by "
"the end of his chapter, he had revealed himself as a helplessly worthless child."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫C’est vrai... ⟪k:2⟫Au début, Mell ressemblait à un jeune homme assez sympathique, mais "
"à la fin de son chapitre, il s’était révélé en enfant démuni et lâche."

